{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AdhA4vC_wE-_ZZTn62YwuA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:23.620257+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AdhA4vC_wE-_ZZTn62YwuA","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>重庆大学化学化工学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2027年推荐免试攻读研究生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（含直博生）招生预报名公告</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icibibcCcvwhvx1lc803ojic2xEszWoKhYvpnwFoDzUUfgXKM2WiaoVvrP8JPSF7F2ibkxPq7iaZ2B4icmzJPRxFscD1OSLibQrUsY9ZLrac/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，品学兼优，学风端正，无考试作弊、学术不端及其它违纪违法记录。</span></p><p><span>2. 经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的拟获得推免资格的2027届应届本科生。</span></p><p><span>3. 参加全国大学外语四级考试成绩达到425分及以上，或者参加托福考试成绩≥80分，或者参加雅思考试成绩≥5.5分。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icib86Gahicaia2vDekRSjSQ8lQW7kfGMPVzR2AVYLIR3MZXoF5c48W9Mad8CGJIMFibg2ibCN41nAKs4hIZ5gicoBU9hnYqq47EYdTnKA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icib98f2IFZib7iaibBxKlHsdEyCSibpYXhM37EJO8xuGv2ANqF6RRw7hRl0tPpc1A2Uat0F4Ac70xm6Uy0X0MjfC9MjmsKpEKsU70icRw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icibibW5pFuwjib6xbsvSYLcHAb7hnZvNhz5Fiak8Z7F717uucKf5SqxUFgEbhS6MlN1cgtVCWOV4FiaLwqzOCcfMwwcOVYBho4Uwj4So/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>凡符合上述报名条件，且有意愿报考我院2027年推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）的应届本科毕业生（以下简称“推免生”），即日起至2026年9月16日24:00，请登录“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”（网址：http://syk.cqu.edu.cn），准确填写各项信息，提交相关报名材料。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）身份证、学生证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科成绩单扫描件（包括专业人数和本人在全专业学生中的总成绩排名；须加盖学校或者学院公章）；</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>（4）校级及以上获奖证书和公开发表的学术论文等证明自身能力的材料；</span></p><p><span>（5）附件1：《2027年重庆大学化学化工学院预推免基本情况信息表》。</span></p><p><span>请将上述材料（1）至（4）按顺序扫描合并为一个PDF文件，上传至报名系统。此前已在系统提交预报名的同学无需重复提交。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审查</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>院根据申请材料，以学业水平、科研能力和综合素质等为主要评价依据，进行资格审查。审查结果将通过“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”发布，并向通过者发送站内消息。请推免生及时关注本人手机短信及系统站内信息。收到考核通知的推免生，请及时在系统中确认是否参加考核。</span></p><p><span>学院将在考核合格的推免生中，结合导师意见，择优选拔直博生。有意申请直博生的同学，可在报名备注栏中填写“意向申请直博生及导师姓名”。</span></p><p><span>通过资格审查的推免生请加入“重大化院27级硕士推免群”（QQ群号：417748031）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>考核内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>考核内容包括：英语水平、专业基础知识以及专业综合能力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>考核形式、时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>考核形式为线下考核，考核时间拟定为2026年9月19日。具体安排将在QQ群中另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>考核成绩公示</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>考核成绩在重庆大学化学化工学院网站公布考核成绩及排名，公示期为三个工作日。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟录取工作</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icib9Dfic4Bthh0GcXiciaMopkZTRR6aBwA1BMwZENWXkS5daOKlyNWyHxdWzIfVS1J0zYveUgeozIlxp9vFlVE6AHrceTibyQ5ULribf0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 推免生录取遵循公平、公正、公开的原则，在各专业拟接收推免指标限额内，按照考核成绩排名从高到低依次拟录取。</span></p><p><span>2. 考核合格的推免生在获得本科院校推免资格后，须于2026年9月下旬（具体时间以教育部正式通知为准）登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址：</span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span>，以下简称“推免服务系统”）进行报名，并按照系统要求完成相关待录取手续，直至系统显示“待录取”状态。推免生收到待录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过系统确认接受拟录取，逾期未确认者，视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>监督与复议</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icib8b4XK5VHfgREOqksDduxxzSGfH02FDwHPuIa9CibIV9oHWT2zeRbgnHjX80OibQBs9b2x8qjJXk4RkkhqxibSafUaEy0LNqJicSbU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院推免生工作领导小组在考核成绩公布后三个工作日内受理推免生实名书面申诉，电子邮箱：1342683343@qq.com。</span></p><p><span>其它未尽事宜，按照重庆大学招生相关文件及我院后续补充通知执行。</span></p><p><span>本公告解释权归重庆大学化学化工学院推免生接收工作领导小组。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询与联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icib9uZjywzT2NEo3BSMkCaA512fpiciclELW33RibMmBq2HJGMqujHj47uuVClsmHBdGv8NibpicicOpiafada21IwCcuKCW5zZvcBJRMico/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>重庆大学化学化工学院研究生教务办公室：罗老师，刘老师，023-65678938。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sgLZkHO8icibicm0UJ7BZzgicq6PryCrGeErkABOuTPlEV8N1liaWIQ64mIhh9ZGlmr8fx1CEJE1rjzVg9pkSXLicqR7wlEJbO2QoxG3yZFwsktJY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>【特别提示】“预推免系统”不能替代国家正式推免平台。预录取推免生须在国家研招网推免系统开放后，完成最终报名及录取流程。</span></p><p><span>1. 推免生必须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性。若推免生提交的信息不真实或不准确，一经查实，不予录取。</span></p><p><span>2. 政审或体检不合格，以及在入学报到时未获得毕业证书及学士学位证书者，不予录取。</span></p><p><span>3. 请持续关注重庆大学研究生招生信息网（https://yz.cqu.edu.cn/ss_news.html）和重庆大学化学化工学院官网（https://hgxy.cqu.edu.cn/）的相关通知，因推免生个人疏忽等原因造成的一切后果由其本人承担。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><strong><span>- END -</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>文字丨罗   平</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑丨史荣梦</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>校对丨李梦娜</span></p><p><span>审核丨胡宝山</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7768db28497f718d5f16df842c9daf4023f9f676dddd202bec3cb3721b2c4fc9","textLength":1683,"sourceSha256":"00e0a78fb81307929562d29060f751a7e967984ca9b22b8c54c2dc489da85f68","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-08ee12b3729edb684ca3","title":"2026年重庆大学化学化工学院2027年推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）招生预报名公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:23.620257+00:00"}
